WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.300
Input always gives back text. Int turns it into a number.

2
00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:08.701
Input gives back text, even when you type digits.

3
00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:19.444
So plus joins the text five and five into fifty-five.

4
00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:24.124
Int turns the text into a number. Now plus adds.
